//==
// # Face outcomes witnesses (complexity sweep, chunk L3)
//
// A discretized witness's faces each meshed once per sweep by MeshFace, so the face-outcome proof
// laws (pipeline-proofs-mesh.laws.plato) read the outcomes instead of calling MeshFace, and with it
// DiscretizeAll, per face per case. Layer 8's: its values use the witness options' face criteria.

// The outcomes MeshFace gives every face of Discretized's model over Discretized's table.
// Invariant: Outcomes[f] is Discretized.Model.MeshFace(BrepFaceIndex(f), Discretized.Discretizations,
// MeshingOptions.WitnessOptions.Face), one per face in face order.
type FaceOutcomesWitness
{
    Discretized: DiscretizedWitness;
    Outcomes: Array<FaceMeshOutcome>;
}
